{"label":"moniker","id":33446,"type":"edge","outV":33433,"inV":33445}
{"label":"resultSet","id":33447,"type":"vertex"}
{"label":"range","id":33448,"type":"vertex","start":{"line":148,"character":7},"end":{"line":148,"character":29},"tag":{"type":"definition","text":"moniker_to_ocel_object","kind":12,"fullRange":{"start":{"line":148,"character":0},"end":{"line":164,"character":1}}}}
{"label":"contains","id":33449,"type":"edge","outV":33221,"inVs":[33448]}
{"label":"next","id":33450,"type":"edge","outV":33448,"inV":33447}
{"label":"hoverResult","id":33451,"type":"vertex","result":{"contents":{"kind":"markdown","value":"```rust\npub fn moniker_to_ocel_object(\n    scheme: &str,\n    identifier: &str,\n    kind: &MonikerKind,\n    unique: &UniquenessLevel,\n) -> serde_json::Value\n```\n\nExport a code symbol (identified by its moniker) as an OCEL 2.0 object.\nIts `id` is the moniker join key, so any receipt event that produced this\nsymbol can reference it by the same identity an LSIF consumer would resolve."}}}
